This covers src/NOpenNLP.Tools/Stemmer/Snowball: the Among and
SnowballProgram runtime, vendored from the Snowball compiler's C# runtime,
and the stemmers under Generated/, produced by running that compiler's C#
backend over the Snowball algorithm sources. Apache OpenNLP generates the
same stemmers from the same sources with the compiler's Java backend.

The test suite includes the Prepositional Phrase Attachment Dataset from
Ratnaparkhi, Reynar, & Roukos, "A Maximum Entropy Model for Prepositional
Phrase Attachment". ARPA HLT 1994. The data is licensed under the Apache
License 2.0; please cite the above paper when the data is redistributed.

